{"chapter": "descent", "math_text_regions": [{"delimiter_kind": "display-dollar", "pieces": [{"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0001"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0002"}], "region_id": "math/0001", "slots": [{"boundary_placeholders": ["MATHSEG_0001", "MATHSEG_0002"], "classification_witness": {"anchor": {"file": "descent.tex", "kind": "lemma", "matches": [{"command_byte_span": {"end": 300845, "start": 300830}, "command_hash": "sha256:828805d88327151a6ec2ef49fc14ab616f9885ede8613def76d19e416efc81b0", "container_byte_span": {"end": 300903, "start": 300676}, "container_hash": "sha256:c9d9373d2253619872fe7fa3bf8c90623ca635c44f85046a0f13bee6af4d39cd"}], "ordinal": 1, "owner_label": "descent-lemma-flat-at-point", "owner_tag": "04ND", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14"}, "policy_hash": "sha256:2762bd3987f6da68e373928da96eb653423d86d2bb52a1fb1599c98eec53a4ff", "source_label": "descent-lemma-flat-at-point", "usage": "root-condition", "usage_source": {"after": "\n$", "before": "}", "environments": []}}, "command": "text", "policy_entry": "descent-is-flat", "slot_byte_span": {"end": 91, "start": 83}, "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001", "source": " is flat"}], "source": "$$\n\\mathcal{P}((X, x) \\to (S, s)) =\n\\mathcal{O}_{S, s} \\to \\mathcal{O}_{X, x}\\text{ is flat}\n$$", "source_byte_span": {"end": 172, "start": 77}, "source_hash": "sha256:afaf38157243cc85e256008c89654c76a0ba1ae58bba85324793e7cc445d09b1"}], "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATHSEG_0001": "$$\n\\mathcal{P}((X, x) \\to (S, s)) =\n\\mathcal{O}_{S, s} \\to \\mathcal{O}_{X, x}\\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "}\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-flat-at-point}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5272af4057901a83918ab9e95363e49e0c3c40e6018b18854ca0cc5fb3bb2044", "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:27f242184566faca35fd013a2f535e17497ae5a079620d03026e021a68e0be63", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a6a5ba45bb36f7f31e31d0b18b04b26233fdf5bf2c89b05c583cf7be4c01f696", "source_text": "The property of morphisms of germs\n<MATHSEG_0001> is flat<MATHSEG_0002>\nis <ACCENT_0001>tale local on the source-and-target.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b63e219ba4208b9c97385522db1f46987676c9ed0ec99e4f0bd874076ee14ca5", "unit_id": "tag:04ND:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{O}_{U', u'} & \\mathcal{O}_{V', v'} \\ar[l] \\\\\n\\mathcal{O}_{U, u} \\ar[u] & \\mathcal{O}_{V, v} \\ar[l] \\ar[u]\n}\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$R = \\mathcal{O}_{V, v}$", "MATH_0003": "$S = \\mathcal{O}_{U, u}$", "MATH_0004": "$M = \\mathcal{O}_{U', u'}$", "MATH_0005": "$$\n\\mathcal{O}_{V', v'} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_{V, v}} \\mathcal{O}_{U, u}\n\\longleftarrow\n\\mathcal{O}_{V', v'}\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n\\mathcal{O}_{U', u'}\n\\longleftarrow\n\\mathcal{O}_{V', v'} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_{V, v}} \\mathcal{O}_{U, u}\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{O}_{U, u}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-local-source-target-at-point}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-section-etale}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-local-flat-ff}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-flat-permanence}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-flat-base-change}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-map-between-etale}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:1e5df2742906c484091061786a8ec60719d996300cc615831946e7402453d1d8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:69ea31bf1bae30ef6e8a72982df0d015c4675e8328aa134b3b9af0723dd25f13", "source_text": "Given a diagram as in\nDefinition <REF_0001>\nwe obtain the following diagram of local homomorphisms of local rings\n<MATH_0001>\nNote that the vertical arrows are localizations of <ACCENT_0001>tale ring maps,\nin particular they are essentially of finite presentation, flat,\nand unramified (see\nAlgebra, Section <REF_0002>).\nIn particular the vertical maps are faithfully flat, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nNow, if the upper horizontal arrow is flat, then the lower horizontal\narrow is flat by an application of\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0004>\nwith <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003> and\n<MATH_0004>. If the lower horizontal arrow is\nflat, then the ring map\n<MATH_0005>\nis flat by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0005>.\nAnd the ring map\n<MATH_0006>\nis a localization of a map between <ACCENT_0002>tale ring extensions of\n<MATH_0007>, hence flat by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0006>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:74732656b6ec4fcb77842a4f573c62d2d529f20cdbe6b54403fd2e508f5d9ddb", "unit_id": "tag:04ND:proof"}
